    <div class="hero-text">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="heroEyebrow">Certified interior decorator · Dubai</p>
      <h1 data-i18n="heroH1">Make your house feel like <em>home.</em></h1>
      <p class="lead" data-i18n="heroLead">I'm Farnaz Sadeghian. For years I designed and staged homes across Dubai. Now I teach everyday families how to style the home they already have: smarter layouts, better buys, and rooms that feel warm to live in.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-solid" href="https://www.instagram.com/decor.with.farnaz/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg><use href="#i-ig"/></svg><span data-i18n="heroFollow">Follow on Instagram</span></a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#collab" data-i18n="heroBrands">Brand collaborations</a>
      </div>
      <div class="creds">
        <span data-i18n="cred1">TAFE Australia certified</span>
        <span data-i18n="cred2">50+ homes staged in Dubai</span>
      </div>
