      <p class="lead" data-i18n="brandP">Interior decoration, architecture and everyday styling, explained simply. This is the world of Decor with Farnaz.</p>
      <figure class="quote">
        <blockquote data-i18n="quote">“Our first skin is the one we are born with. The second is our clothes. The third is our home.”</blockquote>
        <figcaption><span data-i18n="quoteBy">After Friedensreich Hundertwasser, artist and architect, and his theory of the five skins</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

