      <img decoding="async" width="540" height="772" class="book-closed" src="img/book-closed.webp" alt="" data-i18n-alt="altBook" loading="lazy">
      <span class="book-badge" data-i18n="bookBadge">Coming soon</span>
    </div>
    <div class="book-copy reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="bookEyebrow">Her book</p>
      <h2><span data-i18n="bookTitle">Soul of the <em>Room</em></span></h2>
      <p class="book-sub" data-i18n="bookSub">A Journey Through Interior Styles</p>
      <p data-i18n="bookP2">Fifty interior styles, from Japandi to Art Deco, explained the way Farnaz teaches every day: where each style comes from, what defines it, and how to bring it into a real home without starting over.</p>
      <ul class="book-points">
        <li><b>50</b><span data-i18n="bookPt1">interior styles</span></li>
