      <button type="button" class="offer" data-type="Brand collaboration"><h3 data-i18n="o2">Brand ambassador</h3><span data-i18n="o2t">Long term</span><p data-i18n="o2d">An ongoing partnership across a season of content, stories and launches.</p><i class="enq" data-i18n="enq">Enquire</i></button>
      <button type="button" class="offer" data-type="Event or showroom visit"><h3 data-i18n="o3">Showroom &amp; launch visits</h3><span data-i18n="o3t">Dubai · UAE</span><p data-i18n="o3d">On-site content from your store, showroom, project or event.</p><i class="enq" data-i18n="enq">Enquire</i></button>
      <button type="button" class="offer" data-type="Brand collaboration"><h3 data-i18n="o4">Product edits</h3><span data-i18n="o4t">Stories · Guides</span><p data-i18n="o4d">Curated picks and styling guides that send followers straight to buy.</p><i class="enq" data-i18n="enq">Enquire</i></button>
      <button type="button" class="offer" data-type="Brand collaboration"><h3 data-i18n="o5">Developer &amp; staging content</h3><span data-i18n="o5t">Real estate</span><p data-i18n="o5d">Styling stories for new homes, built on her experience staging 50+ properties.</p><i class="enq" data-i18n="enq">Enquire</i></button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="faq" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap faq-grid">
    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="faqEyebrow">Questions</p>
      <h2 data-i18n="faqH2">Interior design in Dubai, <em>answered</em></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-list reveal">
      <details class="faq-item" open><summary><h3 data-i18n="q1">Does Farnaz offer interior design services in Dubai?</h3><span class="faq-ic" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p data-i18n="a1">Yes. Through Third Skin Interiors, Farnaz Sadeghian offers interior design consultations, 3D design and visualisation, and full interior projects for apartments, villas and show homes across Dubai and the UAE.</p></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary><h3 data-i18n="q2">What does an interior design consultation include?</h3><span class="faq-ic" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p data-i18n="a2">A focused session in your home or by video covering layout, colour, lighting and what to buy, followed by a clear written plan you can follow at your own pace.</p></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary><h3 data-i18n="q3">Can I see my room in 3D before buying furniture?</h3><span class="faq-ic" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p data-i18n="a3">Yes. Farnaz plans rooms in realistic 3D, with furniture, finishes and lighting to scale, so you can see the result before spending anything. Each of her 50+ home staging projects was planned in 3D first.</p></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary><h3 data-i18n="q4">Is Farnaz Sadeghian a certified interior decorator?</h3><span class="faq-ic" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p data-i18n="a4">Yes. She is certified through TAFE in Australia and has six years of professional practice in interior design, consultation and home staging in Dubai.</p></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary><h3 data-i18n="q5">How can brands work with Decor with Farnaz?</h3><span class="faq-ic" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p data-i18n="a5">Brands partner with her through sponsored reels, long-term ambassadorships, showroom and launch visits, product edits and real estate content, reaching around 390,000 followers on Instagram (@decor.with.farnaz) and Facebook.</p></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary><h3 data-i18n="q6">What is her book, Soul of the Room?</h3><span class="faq-ic" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p data-i18n="a6">Soul of the Room: A Journey Through Interior Styles is Farnaz's upcoming book on 50 interior styles, from Japandi to Art Deco: where each style comes from, what defines it and how to bring it into a real home.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="contact" id="contact">
  <div class="wrap contact-grid">
    <div class="reveal">
      <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="contact-logo" src="img/tsi-badge-wine.svg" alt="Third Skin Interiors by Farnaz Sadeghian" width="220" height="253">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="contactEyebrow">Contact</p>
      <h2 data-i18n="contactH2">Let's create <em>something beautiful</em></h2>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-top:18px" data-i18n="contactLead">For collaborations, campaigns, events and media, send a message. Farnaz or her team will reply within two working days.</p>
      <div class="channels">
        <a class="channel" id="waLink" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-wa"/></svg></span>
          <span><small data-i18n="chWa">WhatsApp</small><b data-phone dir="ltr"></b></span>
          <svg><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg>
        </a>
        <div class="channel">
          <span class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-mail"/></svg></span>
          <span><small data-i18n="chEmail">Email</small><b data-email dir="ltr"></b></span>
          <button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="email" data-i18n="copy">Copy</button>
        </div>
        <a class="channel" href="https://www.instagram.com/decor_farnaz/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-ig"/></svg></span>
          <span><small data-i18n="chIg">Collaborations on Instagram</small><b dir="ltr">@decor_farnaz</b></span>
          <svg><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <form id="inquiry" novalidate class="reveal">
      <h3 data-i18n="formH3">Send an inquiry</h3>
      <div class="row">
        <label for="f-name"><span data-i18n="fName">Name</span><input id="f-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required></label>
        <label for="f-company"><span data-i18n="fCompany">Company or brand</span><input id="f-company" name="company" autocomplete="organization"></label>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <label for="f-email"><span data-i18n="fEmail">Email</span><input id="f-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required dir="ltr"></label>
        <label for="f-phone"><span data-i18n="fPhone">Phone / WhatsApp</span><input id="f-phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" dir="ltr"></label>
      </div>
      <input type="text" name="_honey" class="hp" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true">
      <label for="f-type"><span data-i18n="fType">Type of inquiry</span>
        <select id="f-type" name="type">
          <option value="Brand collaboration" data-i18n="opt1">Brand collaboration</option>
          <option value="Sponsored content" data-i18n="opt2">Sponsored content</option>
          <option value="Event or showroom visit" data-i18n="opt3">Event or showroom visit</option>
          <option value="Media or interview" data-i18n="opt4">Media or interview</option>
          <option value="Book" data-i18n="opt5">Book</option>
          <option value="Interior design consultation" data-i18n="s1">Interior design consultation</option>
          <option value="3D design" data-i18n="s2">3D design &amp; visualisation</option>
          <option value="Interior project" data-i18n="s3">Full interior project</option>
          <option value="Other" data-i18n="opt6">Other</option>
        </select>
      </label>
      <label for="f-msg"><span data-i18n="fMsg">Message</span><textarea id="f-msg" name="message" required data-i18n-ph="fMsgPh" placeholder="Tell us about your brand, timing and budget"></textarea></label>
      <p class="err" id="formErr" role="alert"></p>
      <button class="btn btn-solid" type="submit" style="justify-self:start"><span data-i18n="fSubmit">Send inquiry</span> <svg><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></button>
      <div class="sent" id="sent" hidden>
        <h3 id="sentH3" data-i18n="sentH3">Your message is ready</h3>
        <p id="sentP" data-i18n="sentP">Send it on WhatsApp in one tap, or copy it into an email.</p>
        <pre id="sentText" dir="auto"></pre>
        <div class="acts">
          <a class="btn btn-solid" id="sentWa" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg><use href="#i-wa"/></svg><span data-i18n="sentWa">Send on WhatsApp</span></a>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost" type="button" id="sentCopy" data-i18n="sentCopy">Copy message</button>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost" type="button" id="sentEdit" data-i18n="sentEdit">Edit</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
</main>

<dialog class="launch" id="launchDlg" aria-labelledby="launchH">
  <form method="dialog" class="launch-close-f"><button class="launch-x" type="submit" data-i18n-aria="lClose" aria-label="Close">&times;</button></form>
  <div class="launch-body" id="launchForm">
    <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="540" height="772" class="launch-book" src="img/book-closed.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true">
    <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="bookEyebrow">Her book</p>
    <h3 id="launchH" data-i18n="lH">Be first to read <em>Soul of the Room</em></h3>
    <p class="launch-p" data-i18n="lP">Leave your email and Farnaz will tell you the day the book launches, with a first look inside.</p>
    <form id="launchF" novalidate>
      <label><span data-i18n="fName">Name</span><input name="name" autocomplete="name" required></label>
      <label><span data-i18n="fEmail">Email</span><input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required dir="ltr"></label>
      <label class="consent"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" value="yes" required><span><span data-i18n="lConsent">I agree to get emails from Farnaz about the book and new decor ideas. I can unsubscribe at any time.</span> <a href="privacy/" target="_blank" data-i18n="privacy">Privacy policy</a></span></label>
      <input type="text" name="_honey" class="hp" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true">
      <p class="err" id="launchErr" role="alert"></p>
      <button class="btn btn-solid" type="submit"><span data-i18n="lBtn">Join the list</span></button>
      <p class="launch-note" data-i18n="lNote">No spam. Unsubscribe anytime.</p>
    </form>
  </div>
  <div class="launch-done" id="launchDone" hidden>
    <span class="launch-tick" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12.5l4.2 4.2L19 7"/></svg></span>
    <h3 data-i18n="lOkH">You're on the list</h3>
